  "name": "Cucumber-Mango Salsa",
  "subtitle": "A bright, chilled fruit-and-vegetable salsa",
  "description": "Diced mango, cucumber, onion, jalapeño, cilantro, garlic, and lime juice make a fresh salsa suited to snacking or serving with chips.",
